  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kamer Efficiency Audit 2018</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Kamer Efficiency Audit 2018</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Den planerade insatsen syftar till att bed&#xf6;ma KAMERs interna styrning och kontroll f&#xf6;r att leverera narrativ och finansiell rapportering av &#xf6;nskv&#xe4;rd kvalitet samt dess system och rutiner n&#xf6;dv&#xe4;ndiga f&#xf6;r att uppn&#xe5; planerade resultat. Revisionen f&#xf6;rv&#xe4;ntas identifiera eventuella svagheter samt presentera rekommendationer f&#xf6;r att &#xe5;tg&#xe4;rda dessa.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This assignment aims at assessing the internal management and control of KAMER are adequate to ensure quality and accuracy of narrative and financial reports. The aim is to assess whether KAMER has appropriate systems and routines for managing KAMER&#x2019;s activities to achieve the operational goals. The efficiency audit is expected to identify eventual weaknesses and to present recommendations to address these.</narrative>
  </description>
